&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moment Energy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Independent energy is here. Help us deploy it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Energy should be free.&amp;nbsp; Free from aging grids, fragile supply chains, and unnecessary extraction. At Moment Energy, we’re building a world where clean power is abundant, affordable, and uninterrupted for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The world doesn’t need another promise about energy; it needs proof that a freer future is possible. Moment Energy is the pragmatic liberator of power, the only company certified to turn the largest untapped energy supply into independent energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Now is the moment. While the industry scraps millions of batteries with decades of life left, we put them to work by repurposing large-format batteries into advanced battery energy storage systems that deliver real-world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We were told second-life batteries would never be safe enough or scalable enough. We didn’t argue, we engineered the solution. Today, Moment Energy delivers 5x the energy density and holds the certifications required to deploy energy independence at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now is the moment. Join us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moment Energy is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Battery Assembly Lead Hand&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the safe assembly, inspection, and testing of our battery energy storage systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this hands-on leadership role, you&#39;ll oversee a production team responsible for assembling battery modules, power electronics, and high-voltage components into complete energy storage systems. Working closely with our Manufacturing, Engineering, and Quality teams, you&#39;ll help ensure every product meets the highest standards of safety, quality, and performance while supporting the growth of our manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the final assembly of high-voltage battery systems, including battery modules, busbars, structural components, and high-voltage wire harnesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install power electronics, control boards, and low-voltage wire harnesses, ensuring proper alignment and termination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all electrical connections meet required torque specifications and accurately record torque values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform detailed visual and physical inspections of incoming battery modules and completed battery packs, checking for damage, defects, and foreign object debris (FOD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct insulation resistance (Megger/Hi-Pot) and voltage continuity testing before battery packs are energized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate documentation of cell voltages, serial numbers, component batch numbers, and torque values for every battery pack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely connect battery packs to automated charge/discharge test stations and run Battery Management System (BMS) test profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor charge/discharge testing and verify system performance throughout the testing process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce live-work boundaries to maintain a safe battery assembly environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow arc flash safety protocols by properly using CAT 4 (40 cal/cm²) arc flash suits, Class 0/1 insulated gloves, face shields, and other required PPE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure battery safety equipment, including safety hooks, fire blankets, sand tables, and thermal cameras, is ready for use at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for individuals with the following traits, skills, and experiences:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience with high-voltage battery systems (300V–1000V+) or high-power electrical systems in a manufacturing, testing, or industrial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assembling, integrating, inspecting, and testing electrical or battery systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using electrical test equipment such as digital multimeters, insulation resistance testers (Megger/Hi-Pot), battery cyclers, and similar diagnostic equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of high-voltage electrical safety practices and energized work procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification or training in CSA Z462 (Workplace Electrical Safety), NFPA 70E, or equivalent electrical safety standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in energized electrical environments while using Category 4 (CAT 4) arc flash PPE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining accurate production, quality, and traceability documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead production activities, mentor technicians, and uphold high standards of workmanship and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and organizational skills in a fast-paced manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and commitment to following structured assembly, testing, and quality procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canadian Journey-person certification (Industrial Electrician, Electronics Technician, or a related trade).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with lithium-ion battery systems, battery energy storage systems (BESS), or electric vehicle (EV) battery manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in aerospace, marine, renewable energy, or other high-voltage industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Battery Management Systems (BMS), CAN bus communication, and battery diagnostic software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting continuous improvement initiatives within a manufacturing or production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Today, we’re delivering 5x the energy density and have all the certifications needed to ship energy independence to the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be part of a mission-driven company focused on creating sustainable energy solutions and making a positive impact on the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with passionate co-founders and a team committed to innovation and excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to building and scaling a company from the ground up, where your work will have a direct and meaningful impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in a workplace that values collaboration, wellness, and celebrating successes, with regular company socials, fitness sessions, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re a fast-paced and dynamic team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day you&#39;ll be taking on a new challenge and learning something new. You&#39;ll take on a wide breadth of tasks and contribute to disrupting the battery industry. You&#39;ll be part of a tight-knit team that is working together to save the planet! Fun, health, and wellness are incorporated into our daily schedule and we encourage all our team members to bring innovative ideas to the table to create an interactive workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
